    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan Northwest are delighted to bring this charming stone-built traditional Irish Cottage to market. Crimlin Cottage is steeped in local Irish history, with connections to the Irish music scene dating back to the early 1800's. This cosy 2-bedroom cottage is located on a c.7.4 Acre site nestled in the South Sligo landscape. \r\n\r\nThe property offers a quiet and peaceful location, yet is just 6 minutes from Tubbercurry and 25 minutes to Sligo Town. Ireland West Airport (Knock Airport) is just 20 minutes away.\r\n\r\nThe cottage has a mains water supply, septic tank, mains electricity and broadband. A solid-fuel stove is located in the main living room, and the cottage also benefits from oil-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nA large workshop is located adjacent to the property, currently used to manufacture musical instruments, and a large glasshouse/polytunnel is to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nThis stone-built cottage is ready to move into or would make an ideal project for those who wish to avail of SEAI grants to modernise the property.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the sole agents.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
